@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080

### Login válido — mesmo contrato do aplicativo Android
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "login": "aluno",
  "senha": "123"
}

### Segundo aluno
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "login": "maria",
  "senha": "456"
}

### Senha incorreta — deve responder 401 e campo message
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "login": "aluno",
  "senha": "senha-errada"
}

### Campos vazios — deve responder 400
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "login": "",
  "senha": ""
}
